       "id": "69f1c9dea5706a322e108469",
       "headline": "Of the total proposed investment, around Rs 1,080 billion will be deployed for the data centre cluster, while Rs 513 billion will be invested in the associated renewable energy project.",
       "event_type": "capital_infusion",
