      {
       "id": "69f0e2fa45272de32e8bf87f",
       "headline": "For the year ended March 31, 2026, the company has reported 24.36% rise in its net profit at Rs 43,851 crore as compared to Rs 35,262 crore for the previous year. However, total income of the company decreased by 0.20% at Rs 5,47,779 crore for year under review as compared to Rs 5,48,886 crore for year ended March 31, 2025.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "ril.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-28T04:28:07",
       "url": "https://udaipurkiran.com/reliance-industries-soars-despite-its-consolidated-net-profit-declines-13-in-q4fy26/",
       "publisher": "udaipurkiran.com",
       "title": "Reliance Industries soars despite its consolidated net profit declines 13% in Q4FY26"
      },
      {
       "id": "69f0e27e45272de32e8bf057",
       "headline": "Reliance Industries Limited on Friday reported a 12.5 per cent decline in March-quarter net profit, as the global energy crisis weighed on its core oil-to-chemicals business, offsetting gains in its consumer-facing telecom and retail segments. Its net profit of Rs 16,971 crore in the January-March - the fourth and final quarter of 2025-26 fiscal year - was down from Rs 19,407 crore in the same period a year earlier, according to a company statement.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "ril.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-28T04:16:52",
       "url": "https://www.bizzbuzz.news/markets/ril-shares-climb-nearly-3-market-valuation-jumps-by-51838-cr-1389628",
       "publisher": "bizzbuzz.news",
       "title": "RIL shares climb nearly 3%; market valuation jumps by `51,838 cr"
      },
      {
       "id": "69f1c8e0399b489398df759f",
       "headline": "Analysts said the company reported Jan-March (Q4FY26) earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortisation (EBITDA) miss due to weak oil-to-consumer (O2C) margin capture, while high crude premiums and logistics costs offset strong product cracks.",
       "event_type": "earnings",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "ril.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-28T02:46:00",
       "url": null,
       "publisher": null,
       "title": null
      },
      {
       "id": "69f9e124a088760d34c6ee51",
       "headline": "Reliance Industries (RIL) will invest ₹1.6 lakh crore (more than $17 billion) in setting up a 1.5-gigawatt data centre cluster and a captive solar battery storage system in Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh, said people familiar with the matter.",
       "event_type": "capital_infusion",
       "role": "primary",
       "domain": "ril.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-27T22:30:00",
       "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/india/reliance-industries-to-set-up-indias-largest-data-centre-cluster-in-andhra-pradesh/articleshow/130563318.cms",
       "publisher": "economictimes.indiatimes.com",
       "title": "Reliance Industries to set up India’s largest data centre cluster in Andhra Pradesh"
      },
      {
       "id": "69f0e19b45272de32e8bdf59",
       "headline": "Dubai-based port operator DP World has acquired a 49% stake in a soon-to-be-operational multimodal logistics park (MMLP) being developed by a unit of Reliance Industries Ltd at Mappedu near Chennai",
       "event_type": "asset_acquisition",
       "role": "seller",
       "domain": "ril.com",
       "published_at": "2026-04-27T18:53:03",
       "url": "https://indiaseatradenews.com/dp-world-acquires-49-stake-in-reliance-backed-chennai-logistics-park-ahead-of-launch/",
       "publisher": "indiaseatradenews.com",
       "title": "DP World Acquires 49% Stake in Reliance-Backed Chennai Logistics Park Ahead of Launch - India Seatrade News"
      },
      {
       "id": "69f0eacad32561089420eff1",
